## A note on the underlying documents

The dataset is compiled from public records produced by the State of Nevada, the Nevada Legislative Counsel
Bureau, the City of Reno and other public bodies. Those documents are public records; this compilation,
its structure, its corrections and its documentation are the contribution licensed above.

Where a figure originates in copyrighted journalism (identified in `sources.csv` by `doc_type` of `news` or
`news-investigation`), only the underlying facts are recorded, with attribution and a link. No article text
is reproduced.

## No warranty

The data is provided as is. It is compiled from documents that themselves contain errors. Several are
catalogued in `discrepancies.csv`. For anything consequential, cite the linked primary source.
